{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>The peak of Peor.</b> Balak was a great sorcerer, and he saw that they were destined to be struck through Peor — but he did not know by what. He said: perhaps the curse will take effect upon them from there. And so all who divine by the stars — they see yet do not know what they see (Sotah 12)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:28.747420215Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}